      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170296",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FALSTAFF.\nThough I could scape shot-free at London, I fear the shot here. Here’s no scoring but upon the pate.—Soft! who are you? Sir Walter Blunt. There’s honour for you. Here’s no vanity. I am as hot as molten lead, and as heavy too. God keep lead out of me, I need no more weight than mine own bowels. I have led my ragamuffins where they are peppered. There’s not three of my hundred and fifty left alive, and they are for the town’s end, to beg during life. But who comes here?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170296/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170296/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 482,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1681421,
        "end": 1681939,
        "line": 63272,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@170296",
        "anchor": "sceneV_9.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FALSTAFF.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170818",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Prince Henry.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 18,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170818/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 19,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1681943,
        "end": 1682019,
        "line": 63283,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@170818",
        "anchor": "sceneV_9.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170898",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PRINCE.\nWhat, stand’st thou idle here? Lend me thy sword.\nMany a nobleman lies stark and stiff\nUnder the hoofs of vaunting enemies,\nWhose deaths are yet unrevenged. I prithee\nLend me thy sword.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170898/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170898/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170898/line-3",
          "start": 58,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170898/line-4",
          "start": 95,
          "end": 131,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170898/line-5",
          "start": 132,
          "end": 174,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@170898/line-6",
          "start": 175,
          "end": 193,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1682023,
        "end": 1682266,
        "line": 63286,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@170898",
        "anchor": "sceneV_9.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PRINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171145",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FALSTAFF.\nO Hal, I prithee give me leave to breathe awhile. Turk Gregory never did such deeds in arms as I have done this day. I have paid Percy, I have made him sure.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171145/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171145/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 167,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1682270,
        "end": 1682468,
        "line": 63295,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@171145",
        "anchor": "sceneV_9.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FALSTAFF.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171347",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PRINCE.\nHe is indeed, and living to kill thee.\nI prithee, lend me thy sword.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171347/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171347/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 46,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171347/line-3",
          "start": 47,
          "end": 76,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1682472,
        "end": 1682583,
        "line": 63301,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@171347",
        "anchor": "sceneV_9.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PRINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171462",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FALSTAFF.\nNay, before God, Hal, if Percy be alive, thou gett’st not my sword; but take my pistol, if thou wilt.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171462/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171462/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 111,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1682587,
        "end": 1682729,
        "line": 63307,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@171462",
        "anchor": "sceneV_9.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FALSTAFF.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171608",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PRINCE.\nGive it me. What, is it in the case?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171608/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171608/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 44,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1682733,
        "end": 1682807,
        "line": 63313,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@171608",
        "anchor": "sceneV_9.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PRINCE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171686",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FALSTAFF.\nAy, Hal, ’tis hot, ’tis hot. There’s that will sack a city.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171686/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171686/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 69,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1682811,
        "end": 1682910,
        "line": 63318,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap09/p@171686",
        "anchor": "sceneV_9.3"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FALSTAFF.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171789",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "right"
      ],
      "text": "[The Prince draws out a bottle of sack.]",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 5,
          "end": 11,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 1,
          "end": 39
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-king-henry-the-fourth/sceneV_9.3/p@171789/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 40,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 1682914,
        "end": 1683015,
        "line": 63323,
